    <h1>Corporate and Global Mobility</h1>
    <p class="service-lede">Immigration support for organisations moving talent into the Philippines.</p>

    <p>Organisations relocating staff into the Philippines, or managing an internationally mobile workforce, face a distinct set of immigration requirements. Foreign Immigration Services works with employers to coordinate the immigration side of workforce mobility.</p>

    <h2>How We Can Assist</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Assessing the immigration requirements associated with a proposed assignment or relocation</li>
      <li>Coordinating visa and work-authorisation applications for employees</li>
      <li>Advising on compliance obligations for foreign personnel</li>
      <li>Supporting organisations managing multiple assignees across different circumstances</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Common Situations We Handle</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Relocating employees to the Philippines for a new role or assignment</li>
      <li>Managing visa and compliance requirements for an existing foreign workforce</li>
      <li>Coordinating immigration matters across multiple employees or departments</li>
      <li>Other corporate immigration circumstances</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How the Process Works</h2>
    <ol class="step-list">
      <li>
        <h3>Initial enquiry</h3>
        <p>Tell us about the assignment or workforce need.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Assessment</h3>
        <p>We review the requirements applicable to your organisation and personnel.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Preparation</h3>
        <p>We coordinate the documentation your applications require.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <h3>Submission and ongoing support</h3>
        <p>We manage the application process and provide ongoing compliance support where required.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>What We May Need From You</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Details of your organisation and the employee or employees involved</li>
      <li>The nature and expected duration of the assignment</li>
      <li>Relevant employee documentation, such as passport, qualifications and employment details, as applicable</li>
    </ul>

